Package: WebScrapingWithR
Title: Web Scraping Terrain Visualization Demo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Kenga", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Demonstrates scraping book metadata with rvest, transforming
    the data with tidyverse, and rendering an interactive Plotly terrain
    visualization.
